  "chapter": {
    "bookTitle": "Alma",
    "delineation": "Chapter",
    "number": 63,
    "summary": "Shiblon and later Helaman take possession of the sacred records—Many Nephites travel to the land northward—Hagoth builds ships, which sail forth in the west sea—Moronihah defeats the Lamanites in battle. About 56–52 B.C.",
    "chapterAugmentations": [],
    "verses": [
      {
        "text": "And it came to pass in the commencement of the thirty and sixth year of the reign of the judges over the people of Nephi, that Shiblon took possession of those sacred things which had been delivered unto Helaman by Alma.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 127,
            "end": 134,
            "text": "Alma 38:1 (1–2); 49:30."
          },
          {
            "start": 160,
            "end": 166,
            "text": "Mosiah 1:3; Alma 37:1 (1–12). TG Sacred."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 1,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Alma 63:1",
        "book": "Alma",
        "chapter": 63,
        "verse": 1
      },
      {
        "text": "And he was a just man, and he did walk uprightly before God; and he did observe to do good continually, to keep the commandments of the Lord his God; and also did his brother.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 2,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Alma 63:2",
        "book": "Alma",
        "chapter": 63,
        "verse": 2
      },
      {
        "text": "And it came to pass that Moroni died also. And thus ended the thirty and sixth year of the reign of the judges.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 25,
            "end": 31,
            "text": "See Alma 43–63 for his great contributions."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 3,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Alma 63:3",
        "book": "Alma",
        "chapter": 63,
        "verse": 3
      },
      {
