      {
        "text": "And behold, there were many of the Nephites who did enter therein and did sail forth with much provisions, and also many women and children; and they took their course northward. And thus ended the thirty and seventh year.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 6,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Alma 63:6",
        "book": "Alma",
        "chapter": 63,
        "verse": 6
      },
      {
        "text": "And in the thirty and eighth year, this man built other ships. And the first ship did also return, and many more people did enter into it; and they also took much provisions, and set out again to the land northward.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 50,
            "end": 55,
            "text": "Hel. 3:10."
          }
